{'symbol': 'REG', 'date': '2023-05-18 15:58:00', 'title': 'ALERT: ROWLEY LAW PLLC IS INVESTIGATING PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF URSTADT BIDDLE PROPERTIES INC.', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROWLEY LAW PLLC IS INVESTIGATING POTENTIAL SECURITIES LAW VIOLATIONS BY URSTADT BIDDLE PROPERTIES INC. (NYSE: UBA AND UBP) AND ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS CONCERNING THE PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF THE COMPANY BY REGENCY CENTERS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: REG). STOCKHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE 0.347 SHARES OF REGENCY CENTERS COMMON STOCK FOR EACH SHARE OF URSTADT BIDDLE STOCK THAT THEY HOLD.'}{'symbol': 'REG', 'date': '2023-05-18 07:30:00', 'title': 'REGENCY CENTERS TO ACQUIRE URSTADT BIDDLE PROPERTIES IN ALL-STOCK TRANSACTION', 'text': 'JACKSONVILLE, FLA. AND GREENWICH, CONN., MAY 18, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- REGENCY CENTERS CORPORATION (“REGENCY”) (NASDAQ: REG) AND URSTADT BIDDLE PROPERTIES INC. (“URSTADT BIDDLE” OR “UBP”) (NYSE: UBA AND UBP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE TWO COMPANIES HAVE ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE MERGER AGREEMENT (THE “AGREEMENT”) BY WHICH REGENCY WILL ACQUIRE URSTADT BIDDLE IN AN ALL-STOCK TRANSACTION, VALUED AT APPROXIMATELY $1.4 BILLION, INCLUDING THE ASSUMPTION OF DEBT AND PREFERRED STOCK. THE COMBINED COMPANY IS EXPECTED TO HAVE A PRO FORMA EQUITY MARKET CAPITALIZATION OF APPROXIMATELY $11 BILLION AND TOTAL ENTERPRISE VALUE OF APPROXIMATELY $16 BILLION.'}